      observable: "Restoring `.gitignore`, ignoring generated/runtime artifacts, and staging source changes reduced `./scribe worktree` to 0 untracked source, 0 generated noise, and 0 other untracked."
    confirmed_sessions: []
    human_validated: false
    validated_by_session: null
    titre: "Worktree triage before commit"
    l0_abstract: "Clean dirty repos by ignoring generated/runtime artifacts first, then staging intentional source changes without auto-reverting ambiguous deletions."
    pourquoi: "A dirty worktree with tracked deletions and many untracked files is not fixed by blind cleanup: generated noise must be hidden by ignore policy, secrets must stay ignored, and source changes should become a reviewable staged diff while destructive revert/remove decisions remain explicit."
    contexte: "Git hygiene for SCRIBE/TENOR bundle changes and JJK Messenger source migration."
    liens_causaux:
      source: "JOURNAL-031"
      renforce: ["PAT-003", "PAT-012", "VAC-005"]
